ng 44% of consumers. Additionally, optimize the texture profile to address the moderate penalties associated with low hardness and dryness before further testing, while ensuring future studies recruit a larger, more engaged participant base to improve data reliability.	NEEDS_IMPROVEMENT	2026-05-11 04:32:45.993	2026-05-18 04:56:35.176
